		{
			dependencies: ["19984A527170882C"]
			description: ["The &6Megabar Press&r squeezes a sample between diamond anvils to a million atmospheres. A UHV hull, the robust casing and the diamond anvil parts. Superhydrides, which hold their superconducting state under pressure. Feed samples and nanotwinned diamond by ME; anvils wear, so keep spares."]
			icon: "gtceu:megabar_press"
