		{
			dependencies: ["19984A527170882C"]
			description: ["The &6Electron-Beam Furnace&r melts metal in a vacuum with a beam, so it comes out purer than a coil could make it. A UHV hull, the clean casing and a vacuum system. Six-nines hafnium and tantalum for the single-crystal foundry. Feed bars by ME; the vacuum pump has a hatch of its own."]
			icon: "gtceu:electron_beam_furnace"
			id: "5BD47CE42EDF75A2"
