			description: ["The &6Nitride Magnet Works&r makes a magnet of iron and nitrogen, stronger than any rare earth. A UHV hull, the heatproof casing and iron from the Barnard line. Bonded magnets for the UEV motor and the Mk2 drive. Iron and nitrogen come by ME and pipe; bonding runs on a timer."]
