			description: ["The &6SiC Fibre Plant&r spins silicon carbide into a fibre as strong as steel and a quarter of the weight. A UHV hull, the clean casing and a spinning line. Fibre for the SiC composite plates that the CVI furnace infiltrates. Feed the precursor by pipe; fibre rolls out by ME."]
