			dependencies: ["34F0084064B3AF4F"]
			description: ["The &6CVI Furnace&r fills a woven preform with gas that deposits carbide in the gaps. A UHV hull, the heatproof casing and a gas supply. SiC composite plates, and the HfTaCN coil that the stellar forge uses. Preforms arrive by ME; the cycle is long, so run several furnaces."]
