			dependencies: ["76EFA041DAC4B333"]
			description: ["The &6Stellar Forge&r is a furnace that holds a fragment of a star. A UEV hull, two UEV components, two optical computers and the HfTaCN coil block. The hottest recipes in the pack, which the Mk4 plasma line runs on. Fuel and heat sinks by ME; plan for the byproducts before you start."]
