			dependencies: ["19984A527170882C"]
			description: ["The &6SNSPD Foundry&r grows a nanowire detector that counts single photons. A UHV hull, the photonic casing and superfluid helium for the cold stage. The single-photon detector in the circuits chapter. Helium by pipe; send finished detectors on by ME."]
