			description: ["The &6Van der Waals Stacker&r lays one atomic film on another, in the order the design asks for. A UHV hull, the photonic casing and films from the cleanroom. The graphene modulator and the hBN emitter chip. Films by ME; the stacker returns finished chips in a chest."]
