			dependencies: ["1DCFFEC97F5A28AF", "3EEACFBDD09FDD21"]
			description: ["The &6Photonic Integration Hall&r bonds waveguides, sources and detectors into one optical chip. A UHV hull, the photonic casing and every part the UEV chip asks for. The waveguide circuit, the quantum photonic chip and the optical computer. Parts in matched counts by ME; keep a stock of finished chips and send them to the assembler."]
