		{
			dependencies: ["19984A527170882C"]
			description: ["The &6Helium-3 Polariser&r aligns the spin of each nucleus, so more of them fuse. A UHV hull, the clean casing and a helium-3 supply. Polarised helium-3, the fuel of the Mk4 ring. Helium-3 by pipe; keep the polarised stock sealed and ready."]
